@startuml
title 18_sao_luu_du_lieu
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"

actor "Admin" as Super Admin
participant "Web" as Web Admin CMS
participant "API" as FastAPI
participant "Service" as BackupService
participant "DB" as MongoDB
participant "Storage" as File Storage
Admin -> Web: Nhấn "Tạo bản sao lưu dữ liệu"
Web -> API: POST /api/v1/system/backup
API -> API: Xác thực quyền SuperAdmin
API -> Service: execute_backup()
Service -> DB: Dump collections (POI, Tours, QR, Users)
DB- -> Service: Dữ liệu documents
Service -> Storage: Nén thành file zip và tính SHA-256
Storage- -> Service: Đường dẫn file zip
Service -> DB: Lưu nhật ký sao lưu vào system_backups
Service- -> API: Backup metadata & download link
API- -> Web: 200 OK
Web- -> Admin: Hiển thị file backup & cho phép tải về
@enduml
